src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/albert-duke-of-prussia.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Albert, Duke of Prussia</span><span class="tp">1490–1568</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/matthias-holy-roman-emperor"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/matthias-holy-roman-emperor.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Matthias, Holy Roman Emperor</span><span class="tp">1557–1619</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/lajos-kossuth"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/lajos-kossuth.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Lajos Kossuth</span><span class="tp">1802–1894</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/juliana-of-the-netherlands"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/juliana-of-the-netherlands.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Juliana of the Netherlands</span><span class="tp">1909–2004</span></span></a></li></ul></section>
<p class="day-ppl-note">Dates as the sources give them: in the Julian calendar before 1582, and in some countries for longer (Britain until 1752, Russia until 1918). Only people whose day of birth or death the records agree on are listed.</p>
